登台；传播马克思，新民主开端。","method":"用时间、人物、主张、力量和意义串联","coverage":"1919年巴黎和会上中国外交失败是五四运动的导火索。；青年学生发挥先锋作用，工人阶级在运动后期发挥主力军作用。；五四运动是彻底反帝反封建的爱国运动，中国工人阶级开始登上政治舞台。；五四运动促进马克思主义传播，是中国新民主主义革命的开端。","conditions":["按正文主线记忆，口诀只作检索线索。"],"excludes":["完整文章、口号和人物名单","正文未展开的思想史争议"],"phrases":[{"id":"cs-target-may-fourth-trigger-memory","phrase":"一九巴黎外交败","meaning":"1919年巴黎和会上中国外交失败是五四运动的导火索。","targetIds":["cs-target-may-fourth-trigger"],"coverageType":"trigger","conditionRefs":[],"refs":[{"pointId":"new-culture-may-fourth","tabId":"may-fourth-movement","sourceUnitIds":["cs-1-9-p17-may-fourth-movement-list"],"fingerprint":"f3f0dba0","label":"新文化运动与五四运动 · 五四运动","auditStatus":"ready-for-user-acceptance"}],"questionIds":["may-fourth-trigger","may-fourth-full"],"checks":[{"questionId":"may-fourth-trigger","checkPurpose":"trigger","reviewTarget":"phrase","reviewAnchorId":"cs-target-may-fourth-trigger-memory"},{"questionId":"may-fourth-full","checkPurpose":"full-recheck","reviewTarget":"meaning","reviewAnchorId":"cs-target-may-fourth-trigger-memory"}]},{"id":"cs-target-may-fourth-forces-memory","phrase":"学生先锋，工人后主","meaning":"青年学生发挥先锋作用，工人阶级在运动后期发挥主力军作用。","targetIds":["cs-target-may-fourth-forces"],"coverageType":"forces","conditionRefs":[],"refs":[{"pointId":"new-culture-may-fourth","tabId":"may-fourth-movement","sourceUnitIds":["cs-1-9-p17-may-fourth-movement-list"],"fingerprint":"f3f0dba0","label":"新文化运动与五四运动 · 五四运动","auditStatus":"ready-for-user-acceptance"}],"questionIds":["may-fourth-forces","may-fourth-full"],"checks":[{"questionId":"may-fourth-forces","checkPurpose":"forces","reviewTarget":"phrase","reviewAnchorId":"cs-target-may-fourth-forces-memory"},{"questionId":"may-fourth-full","checkPurpose":"full-recheck","reviewTarget":"meaning","reviewAnchorId":"cs-target-may-fourth-forces-memory"}]},{"id":"cs-target-may-fourth-nature-memory","phrase":"彻底反帝反封建，工人登台","meaning":"五四运动是彻底反帝反封建的爱国运动，工人阶级以独立政治力量登上历史舞台，不等于此前从未有工人抗争。","targetIds":["cs-target-may-fourth-nature"],"coverageType":"nature","conditionRefs":[],"refs":[{"pointId":"new-culture-may-fourth","tabId":"may-fourth-movement","sourceUnitIds":["cs-1-9-p17-may-fourth-movement-list"],"fingerprint":"f3f0dba0","label":"新文化运动与五四运动 · 五四运动","auditStatus":"ready-for-user-acceptance"}],"questionIds":["may-fourth-nature","may-fourth-full"],"checks":[{"questionId":"may-fourth-nature","checkPurpose":"nature","reviewTarget":"phrase","reviewAnchorId":"cs-target-may-fourth-nature-memory"},{"questionId":"may-fourth-full","checkPurpose":"full-recheck","reviewTarget":"meaning","reviewAnchorId":"cs-target-may-fourth-nature-memory"}]},{"id":"cs-target-may-fourth-significance-memory","phrase":"传播马克思，新民主开端","meaning":"五四运动促进马克思主义传播，是中国新民主主义革命的开端。","targetIds":["cs-target-may-fourth-significance"],"coverageType":"significance","conditionRefs":[],"refs":[{"pointId":"new-culture-may-fourth","tabId":"may-fourth-movement","sourceUnitIds":["cs-1-9-p17-may-fourth-movement-list"],"fingerprint":"f3f0dba0","label":"新文化运动与五四运动 · 五四运动","auditStatus":"ready-for-user-acceptance"}],"questionIds":["may-fourth-significance","may-fourth-full"],"checks":[{"questionId":"may-fourth-significance","checkPurpose":"significance","reviewTarget":"phrase","reviewAnchorId":"cs-target-may-fourth-significance-memory"},{"questionId":"may-fourth-full","checkPurpose":"full-recheck","reviewTarget":"meaning","reviewAnchorId":"cs-target-may-fourth-significance-memory"}]}],"questionIds":["may-fourth-trigger","may-fourth-forces","may-fourth-nature","may-fourth-significance","may-fourth-full"]},{"id":"cpc-first-memory","revision":3,"status":"review","scope":"humanities-history","title":"建党基础与一大","purpose":"帮助回忆建党基础与一大。","text":"早期组织、思想阶级与外助；二一上海转南湖，一大立党；陈李未到，十三含包；定名定性、目标任务与统一纪律。","method":"用基础、会议、代表边界和纲领层级串联","coverage":"组织基础是各地共产党早期组织，思想基础是马克思主义传播，阶级基础是工人阶级壮大，外部因素是共产国际帮助。；中共一大于1921年7月23日在上海召开，后转移至浙江嘉兴南湖；大会召开标志中国共产党成立。；毛泽东、李达、李汉俊、张国焘、董必武等出席；陈独秀、李大钊未出席，包惠僧受陈独秀派遣出席但不属于正式党代表。；一大确定中国共产党名称和无产阶级政党性质，提出奋斗目标、组织工人阶级的基本任务及统一组织纪律。","conditions":["按正文主线记忆，口诀只作检索线索。"],"exclud